   "body": "Validated this against current main and confirmed the reported behavior. The MonarchTokenizer.getLoadStatus() method enters an unbounded recursion when processing a circular \nextEmbedded language reference.\n\nThis PR introduces a standard DFS cycle detection set to prevent the stack overflow. Upon detecting a cycle, returning { loaded: true } correctly breaks the graph edge, allowing the remaining asynchronous paths to aggregate without trapping the traversal.\n\nOne point I'd particularly appreciate confirmation on is whether breaking the promise resolution cycle here aligns with how TokenizationRegistry handles cyclic dependencies.",
